    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Many students find the process of applying to university to be daunting. Choosing a degree programme, sitting for admission tests and meeting application deadlines can be intimidating for even the best students. That's why the Aga Khan University has launched a special  Challenge (Scholarship) programme  to motivate students from Pakistan's education system to apply for higher education.",
